{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡流傳一段車Cam片段，顯示事發於昨日（5日）深夜9時50分，車Cam車主沿葵涌道行駛至葵涌及沙田出口位置時，目擊有人竟然無視交通安全，公然橫過多條行車線，險象環生。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-16h10m41s981.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IYRN5va8M31791278389.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-16h10m41s981.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段引發大批網民圍觀及熱議，眾人紛紛對該名行人的危險舉動表達極度憤怒與不滿，大批網民指責其無視生命安全及附近設施，留言怒斥：「貪方便，攞條命嚟較飛」、「前面就有天橋啦」、「貪方便遲早出事」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-16h10m31s554.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GuYnyBDzDo1791278395.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-06-16h10m31s554.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">亦有網民為駕駛者抱不平，直指這種行為害人害己，留言指：「出咗事累埋個司機。」有眼尖網民更翻出舊帳，指出 5 個月前曾有一名婆婆闖入葵涌道並不幸被車撞倒，警惕大家切勿重蹈覆轍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T09:40:11.444077+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}